  "scope": "Durable erasure job with preserved discovery, per-object checkpoints and honest destination status; both hosts, orphans, caches/rings/seen, D1, telemetry/logs and external reconciliation. Server-enforced deletion epoch/replay barrier prevents stale-cookie and delayed/concurrent ingestion resurrection. Retention and physical progress must be tested; operator Set-Cookie alone is not a subject-browser remedy. Complete remaining local implementation under the approved explicit per-category/fail-closed configuration choice, preserving earlier remedies; selected live/historical/customer acceptance stays open for the final authorized batch.",
