  "baseline": {
    "kind": "Source-confirmed remaining-W06 design case, not a new runtime reproduction",
    "case": "Unheld consumer/direct/product-sort barrier check precedes actual writes, so absent/unlisted/visited object races remain; rewrite journals/final delete are unconditional; quiet ring/hourly physical cleanup and retention policy are incomplete; frozen pending-credit basis can conflict with new tombstones. Existing durable jobs, strict persistent barriers, bounded rewrite/discovery, managed delivery/witnesses, W04 authority and W05 consent remain intact.",
